  "faqs": [
    {
      "question": "How does the 7-day free trial work?",
      "answer": "You receive full, unrestricted access to your chosen tier for 168 hours (7 days). No credit card is required at signup. At the end of 7 days, your workspace enters read-only mode until a commercial subscription is activated."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I upgrade or downgrade my tier later?",
      "answer": "Yes. You can switch between Starter, Control, and Pro at any time from your in-app Billing Center. Upgrades take effect immediately with prorated billing."
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens if I exceed my monthly transaction or OCR limits?",
      "answer": "We never freeze read access or interrupt core cash visibility. When you approach 80% and 100% of your quota, the system sends an email notification and provides an option to upgrade or purchase additional unit packs."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does CFO AI replace my local Indonesian tax consultant (Konsultan Pajak)?",
      "answer": "No. CFO AI prepares, structures, and reconciles your general ledger, e-Bupot calculations, and PMK 81/2024 CoreTax schedules. It provides organized readiness exports for your licensed consultant or internal finance team, but does not provide legal tax representation."
    }
  ]
